==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Toxel|62}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion; both cards have the Static Shock attack.
*'''Static Shock''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Mareep|94}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

